cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this audit framework, the 5-Gate Audit Rubric, the Case Evaluation Ledgers (Case 001 to Case 015), or the 17.37M-Line Alpöge-Claude RH/GRH Deep Decompilation & Part B AST Atlas, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Ultari Proof Anatomy: 5-Gate Technical Audit, Formal Dissection Archive & 17.37M-Line Alpöge-Claude RH/GRH Deep Decompilation"
abstract: "Byte-level zero-truncation technical audit, mathematical decompilation, and standalone Lean 4 reconstruction of frontier AI and classical mathematical formal verification corpora (v1.1.0): (1) 15 OpenAI, DeepMind, and classical case studies (892 standalone zero-sorry Lean 4 theorems, 4,217/4,217 hypothesis mutations killed across 44,833 distinct upstream .lean files, >12.4M lines) under the 5-Gate Audit Rubric; and (2) the unified bilingual (EN/KO) deep mathematical decompilation of the 17.37M-line (175,187-file) Levent Alpöge & Claude Riemann Hypothesis (RH) and Dirichlet GRH Lean 4 archive (Part A 148p EN & 132p KO deep monographs, Part B 100.00% AST Atlas across 30,343 modules and 308,731 declarations, 6-volume reader guide 55p EN & 53p KO PDFs, 195/195 literature attribution dictionary, and 61 standalone zero-sorry Lean 4 audit theorems; 953 total standalone theorems across the repository)."
